Subject: [PATCH] Enable linked-device history transfer on clean registration

AI-assisted compatibility changes. Match Signal 8.33 so a newly linked phone advertises history transfer while retaining the existing clean-start guard.

Based-On-Source-Commit: e106c757dca5904f9adce9e332b9f69d11bd4223

Carry this AI-assisted source change as its own
reviewable patch, preserving the original source author and diff.
The official Molly snapshot and earlier resolution patches do
not receive regenerated provenance headers.

